@startuml
title TutorLink - Casos de uso de comunicacion y seguimiento familiar

left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam actorStyle awesome

actor Docente
actor "Tutor academico" as tutor
actor Estudiante
actor "Padre, madre o\ntutor legal" as guardian

rectangle "TutorLink - Comunicacion academica" {
  usecase "Iniciar consulta con\ntutor academico" as UC_AskTutor
  usecase "Responder consulta de\ntutoria" as UC_ReplyTutor
  usecase "Iniciar consulta con\ndocente de la materia" as UC_AskTeacher
  usecase "Responder consulta de\nla materia" as UC_ReplyTeacher
  usecase "Consultar historial de\nconversaciones" as UC_ConversationHistory
  usecase "Adjuntar archivos a\nla consulta" as UC_AttachConsultation
  usecase "Recibir notificacion de\nnueva consulta o respuesta" as UC_ReceiveMessageNotice
  usecase "Consultar seguimiento\nautorizado del estudiante" as UC_GuardianTracking
}

estudiante --> UC_AskTutor
estudiante --> UC_AskTeacher
estudiante --> UC_ConversationHistory
estudiante --> UC_ReceiveMessageNotice

tutor --> UC_ReplyTutor
tutor --> UC_ConversationHistory
tutor --> UC_ReceiveMessageNotice

docente --> UC_ReplyTeacher
docente --> UC_ConversationHistory
docente --> UC_ReceiveMessageNotice

guardian --> UC_GuardianTracking

UC_AskTutor .> UC_AttachConsultation : <<extend>>
UC_AskTeacher .> UC_AttachConsultation : <<extend>>
UC_ReplyTutor .> UC_ConversationHistory : <<include>>
UC_ReplyTeacher .> UC_ConversationHistory : <<include>>
UC_AskTutor .> UC_ReceiveMessageNotice : <<include>>
UC_AskTeacher .> UC_ReceiveMessageNotice : <<include>>
UC_ReplyTutor .> UC_ReceiveMessageNotice : <<include>>
UC_ReplyTeacher .> UC_ReceiveMessageNotice : <<include>>

note bottom of UC_AskTutor
Canal de acompanamiento y tutoria academica.
end note

note bottom of UC_AskTeacher
Canal diferenciado para dudas de una materia o clase.
end note

note bottom of UC_GuardianTracking
El vinculo familiar se autoriza por la institucion.
El familiar consulta seguimiento, sin administrar
clases, tareas ni conversaciones del estudiante.
end note

@enduml
